{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"“双单纯集”"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"双单纯集"},0],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>双单纯集是"},{"Local":{"url":"单纯集","text":"单纯集"}},{"Plain":"范畴中的"},{"Local":{"url":"单纯对象","text":"单纯对象"}},{"Plain":", 也即函子 $\\Delta^{\\text{op}}\\times\\Delta^{\\text{op}} \\to\\mathsf {Set}$. 双单纯集又称单纯空间 (simplicial space).</p>\n<p>双单纯集的范畴记为 $\\mathsf {ssSet}$.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n"}]}}